sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Frontend
  participant Gateway
  participant Role as Role Context
  participant Context as pgvector Context
  participant Gemini
  participant Supabase
  participant Evidence
  User->>Frontend: Submit business question
  Frontend->>Gateway: POST /intelligence/ask
  Gateway->>Role: Load role priorities and KPIs
  Gateway->>Context: Retrieve relevant semantic context
  Context-->>Gateway: Context bundle
  Gateway->>Gemini: Generate SQL, insight, and recommendations
  Gemini-->>Gateway: SQL and narrative
  Gateway->>Supabase: Execute validated read-only SQL
  Supabase-->>Gateway: Result rows
  Gateway->>Evidence: Save insight snapshot
  Gateway-->>Frontend: Answer, SQL, rows, context, recommendations, limitations
